   "ocr": "December 31, 2012 was approximately $14.3 billion. Fair value was estimated using quoted market prices for the\nCompany’s senior notes, senior subordinated notes and senior credit facility. Carrying value of the MGM Grand\nParadise credit facility approximates fair value."
